<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">44 SOUNDS · A WORLD OF WORDS</view><view class="title">声音地图</view><view class="subtitle">字母是线索，音标帮你找到声音。</view><view class="tabs"><button wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" class="tab {{selected === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.name}}</button></view><view class="grid"><navigator wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" url="{{item.url}}" class="card phoneme-card"><view class="ipa">/{{item.symbol}}/</view><view class="word-name">{{item.exampleWord}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.spellings}}</view></navigator></view><view class="footnote">采用传统英式教学音素分类。不同口音的实际发音可能有所差别。</view></view>
